You get that message if 1) Your deity is not angry with you, and 2) your
numerical alignment is zero or positive, and 3) your prayer timeout is
zero.  And if your luck is not already pegged at max.  It means your
luck moved up.  It does not tell you if your luck moved from negative to
positive and that's something important to you right now.

> Then, still in the same process I get a new "You feel partially absolved.". 

